      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KRAKEN GINGER (3) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.4 lengths at Horsham in a handy 27.33 beating Paw Maddison. The form out of his last race has been franked. Looks the testing material. JACQUI MOSS (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 9 lengths at this track in a handy 28.14 beating Perfect Gloss. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. One of the leading chances again. DOONGALLA GHOST (2) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 8 lengths away in third (28.77) at this track in a Grade 5 over 500m. Can measure up. SUNNY STRIDE (8) has strong claims after a long-odds top-three finish last time out.",
